# Derived content of the pcd-translate skill, rebuilt by `make skills`.
# Format: <glob relative to the repository root> <subdirectory in the skill>
# A subdirectory named here is owned by scripts/build-skill.sh.
#
# The translator, reviewer, security-reviewer and tiebreaker prompts are
# copied here until they move into modes/ (record
# 2026-11-03-skills-and-repo-split.md, A-5).
prompts/prompt.md               prompts
prompts/reviewer.md             prompts
prompts/security-reviewer.md    prompts
prompts/tiebreaker.md           prompts
templates/*.template.md         templates
hints/*.hints.md                hints
tools/shared/spec/*.md          references
scripts/check-tools.sh          scripts
